{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Teichmüller空间"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“Teichmüller 空间”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Teichmüller 空间是给定 $2$ 维流形 $\\Sigma$ 上复结构的模空间, 其关于 $\\Sigma$ 所有自同胚的商是"},{"Local":{"url":"曲线的模空间","text":"曲线的模空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}